--- !u!114 &1274708128362537530
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 19
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 19
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: Adelaida se retira./nLa iglesia aprueba que sus pecados sean castigados./nEl
    pueblo desaprueba que delates los secretos que te confiesan.
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 3068.915
    y: 238.97878
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1445387422461888070
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 14
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "Absoluci\xF3n: Solo estabas tratando de hacer lo correcto por ti y los tuyos."
  childrenIDs:
  - 20
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2387.7874
    y: 421.46808
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 1
  RepIglesiaCost: -1
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &1679206554603294953
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 16
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 16
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Entendido, padre./nEs lo m\xE1s justo si pretendo liberarme de la culpa
    que siento."
  childrenIDs:
  - 17
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2730.7876
    y: 43.680893
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 4113829005332862926, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &3355250235812013177
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 12
  isPlayerSpeaking: 1
  text: "Penitencia: Pida perd\xF3n a la familia y presta tus servivios en todo lo
    que necesiten."
  childrenIDs:
  - 16
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2387.7876
    y: 43.680893
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 1
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &3469668424652038452
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 5
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "En mi posada se escuchan rumores de amuletos m\xE1gicos./nDicen que son
    capaces de cumplir los deseos del portador.../nA cambio de un alto precio./nUno
    que no se puede pagar con dinero."
  childrenIDs:
  - 6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 649
    y: 344.5
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 2461851020937167762, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &4667093700172123172
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Aun as\xED, siento culpa por haber dejado marchar a aquella mujer.../nSi
    hubiera actuado de otra forma en cuanto vi aquel colgante.../nEl hijo del molinero
    segur\xEDa hoy con nosotros."
  childrenIDs:
  - 12
  - 13
  - 14
  - 15
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2052.7449
    y: 249.00002
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 6460059290704040764, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &4833016678480741690
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Padre, \xBFse ha enterado de lo del hijo del molinero?/nCreo saber qu\xE9
    le ha sucedido./nEstoy segura de que el colgante que menciona el peri\xF3dico
    tiene algo que ver."
  childrenIDs:
  - 2
  - 3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 5
    y: 245
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 6460059290704040764, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &5843062107677719649
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "En cuanto vi aquella joya en su cuello, le prohib\xED la entrada a la posada./nSi
    los rumores son ciertos, no puedo dejar que un objeto tan peligroso entre a la
    posada./nMas nunca pens\xE9 que acabar\xEDa en manos de un pobre ni\xF1o."
  childrenIDs:
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1005
    y: 234
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: -215640629934891304, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &6554014642214226852
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 9
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "No lo vi necesario./nMientras se mantuviera lejos de mi negocio.../nLos
    problemas se mantendr\xEDan al otro lado de la puerta."
  childrenIDs:
  - 11
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1702.6808
    y: 131.97874
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 2461851020937167762, guid: 841b1cfbdc1185542bc60977d5077a16, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &7195647984904439411
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 20
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: 20
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Escucharlo de su boca libera la carga en mi coraz\xF3n./nSe lo agradezco,
    padre./nMe asegurar\xE9 de que el sacrificio de aquel chico no sea en vano."
  childrenIDs:
  - 21
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2732.7874
    y: 429.46808
